<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There’s a Man in the glory</l><l>Whose Life is for me.</l><l>He overcame Satan;</l><l>From bondage He’s free.</l><l>In Life He is reigning;</l><l>How kingly is He!</l><l>His Life in the glory,</l><l>My life must be;</l><l>His Life in the glory,</l><l>My life must be.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>There’s a Man in the glory</l><l>Whose Life is for me.</l><l>In Him is no sickness;</l><l>No weakness has He.</l><l>He’s strong and in vigor,</l><l>How buoyant is He!</l><l>His Life in the glory</l><l>My life may be;</l><l>His Life in the glory</l><l>My life may be.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>There’s a Man in the glory</l><l>Whose Life is for me.</l><l>His peace is abiding;</l><l>How patient is He!</l><l>He’s joyful and radiant,</l><l>Expecting to see</l><l>His Life in the glory</l><l>Lived out in me;</l><l>His Life in the glory</l><l>Lived out in me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
